<span style=3D"word-break: break-word; font-size: 18px; color: #000000;"><s=
trong>Peter Hurford: </strong>The Thirlwall inquiry has revealed a <a href=
=3D"https://link.thetimes.com/click/47520598.381957/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cudGhldGl=
